OL,3,GNEWSAFancy buying a 742-year-old
OL,4,Aschool? It's yours for #5m
OL,5,
OL,6,FDo you fancy buying a 742-year-old
OL,7,Fschool?
OL,9,FRuthin School in Denbighshire survived
OL,10,Fmore than seven centuries, including
OL,11,Fplagues, civil war and two world wars,
OL,12,Fbefore financial pressures closed its
OL,13,Fdoors for good.
OL,15,FAfter being bought in March 2023, its
OL,16,Fnew owners injected #6.4m into the
OL,17,Fschool over the three years to cover
OL,18,Flosses, but it continued to lose money
OL,19,Fand entered administration in July 2026
OL,20,F- with pupils being told of the closure
OL,21,Fthe day before they broke up for
OL,22,Fsummer.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
