OL,3,GNEWSAFancy buying a 742-year-old
OL,4,Aschool? It's yours for #5m
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow all 12 buildings, a sports field
OL,7,Fand more than 24 acres of agricultural
OL,8,Fland are up for sale for #5m as a guide
OL,9,Fprice according to Sanderson Weatherall
OL,10,Festate agents.
